            "description": "Returns a list of DraftSelections \r\n***\r\nIncluded fields as default:\n* id\r\n* draftType\r\n* year\r\n* round\r\n* overall\r\n* team\r\n* teamName\r\n* player\r\n* _links\r\n***\r\nExcluded fields as default:\n* teamLogo\r\n* teamLogoUrl\r\n* playerTeamBeforeDraft\r\n* playerTeamStatsBeforeDraft\r\n* eliteprospectsUrlPath\r\n* updatedAt",
