            "description": "Returns a list of Transfers \r\n***\r\nIncluded fields as default:\n* id\r\n* player\r\n* playerPosition\r\n* fromTeam\r\n* fromInfo\r\n* toTeam\r\n* toInfo\r\n* type\r\n* date\r\n* _links\r\n***\r\nExcluded fields as default:\n* fromLeague\r\n* toLeague\r\n* sources\r\n* extra\r\n* links\r\n* eliteprospectsUrlPath\r\n* updatedAt",
